{title: Happy Day (FJ_44_en)}
{song_number: 44}
{language: en}

{start_of_verse: 1}
[A]The greatest day in history, [D]death is beaten, You
have [F#m7]rescued me. Sing it out, Jesus is alive! [D]
The empty [A]cross, the empty [D]grave,
life e[F#m7]ternal, You have won the day. Shout it out,
Jesus is a[D]live, He's alive!
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_chorus}
[Esus4]And [E]oh, [A]happy day, [D]happy day!
[F#m7]You washed [E]my sin away.
[A]Oh happy day, [D]happy day! [F#m7]I'll never [E]be the [A]same,
[F#m7]forever [E]I am [A]changed.
{end_of_chorus}

{start_of_verse: 2}
[A]When I stand in that place, [D]free at last, meeting
face to [F#m7]face. I am Yours, Jesus, You are mine. [D]
Endless [A]joy, perfect [D]peace, earthly pain
fi[F#m7]nally will cease. Celebrate, Jesus is a[D]live, He's alive!
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_chorus}
[Esus4]And [E]oh, [A]happy day, [D]happy day!
[F#m7]You washed [E]my sin away.
[A]Oh happy day, [D]happy day! [F#m7]I'll never [E]be the [A]same,
[F#m7]forever [E]I am [A]changed.
{end_of_chorus}

{start_of_bridge}
[F#m7]Oh, what a glorious day, [C#m]what a glorious [Dmaj7]way
that You have [F#m7]saved me. And oh, [C#m]what a glorious day,
what a glorious [Dmaj7]name.
{end_of_bridge}

{start_of_chorus}
[Esus4]And [E]oh, [A]happy day, [D]happy day!
[F#m7]You washed [E]my sin away.
[A]Oh happy day, [D]happy day! [F#m7]I'll never [E]be the [A]same,
[F#m7]forever [E]I am [A]changed.
{end_of_chorus}

{start_of_bridge: Schluss}
[A]Hey! And oh, what a glo[D]rious, glorious day!
[F#m7]I'll nev[E]er be the [A]same.
{end_of_bridge}
